{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "020d2c13-a6dc-5fbb-85cf-2dc6b4056cdc", "source_ordinal": 1734, "reading_ordinal": 2323, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "招蝉", "published_at": "2024-03-02T02:56:46+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/646232103/answer/3415491487"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你如果听信那些闹哄哄的“这次又骗人”的怪话，这没人能说你错，自己为自己的听信负责就行了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 44}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不吃上足够的亏，不为这些嗡嗡声踏空足够多次，甚至选错足够多的边，你总觉得听这些嗡嗡声挺好玩。", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 91}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "用“人家都说”来指导自己的行为，不是一个好的生存策略。", "char_start": 92, "char_end": 119}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你应该听过螳螂捕蝉，黄雀在后吧？", "char_start": 120, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "是这样——", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 142}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "假设有一张三，有一李四，张三解释自己为什么要这么做的时候总会用“人家都说”、“x大牛说”，李四则从来不用。", "char_start": 143, "char_end": 196}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "那么李四是螳螂、黄雀、还是别的什么，这不好说，但张三一定是只蝉。", "char_start": 197, "char_end": 229}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这些嗡嗡声，就是螳螂在招蝉。", "char_start": 230, "char_end": 244}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 8}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0343"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：贵州省省长李炳军：严格兑现政府承诺，全面清理拖欠企业账款，哪些信息值得关注？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008"], "summary": "围绕“招蝉”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你如果听信那些闹哄哄的“这次又骗人”的怪话，这没人能说你错，自己为自己的听信负责就行了。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你如果听信那些闹哄哄的“这次又骗人”的怪话，这没人能说你错，自己为自己的听信负责就行了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 44, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "58dc7401-8a21-5877-9b9e-61b53a9b56c0", "source_ordinal": 1733, "reading_ordinal": 2324, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "未出恶声", "published_at": "2024-03-02T08:52:42+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/644666660/answer/3415592168"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这是一个常见的误解——以为变得优秀就可以让对方喜欢自己。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "实际上那种“为了让别人喜欢而跑去变优秀的人”不但不让人感动，还往往令人感到反感和恶心。", "char_start": 29, "char_end": 72}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "什么叫“为让我喜欢而变优秀”？", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 88}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "第一，你既然现在来了，意思是你认为这个程度的优秀一定可以“征服”我了？", "char_start": 89, "char_end": 124}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "那么这就是你眼里我的上限？", "char_start": 125, "char_end": 138}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "You got me all figured out, is that it?", "char_start": 139, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你原本纠结、忐忑的样子虽然也并不如何可爱，但也要比你现在这副“谅你上限不过如此”的嘴脸可爱一万倍。", "char_start": 179, "char_end": 228}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "意不意外？", "char_start": 229, "char_end": 234}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你甚至不知道自己错在哪里。", "char_start": 235, "char_end": 248}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "第二，我要是现在不感动、不倾倒，你要作何结论？是不是我铁石心肠？我没有人性？", "char_start": 250, "char_end": 288}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "所以你令你自己满意的努力过了，我必须感动、必须倾倒，是吗？", "char_start": 289, "char_end": 318}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "是不是如果我不感动、不倾倒，我就是一个“骗子”？一个“辜负了你的深情”的人？", "char_start": 319, "char_end": 357}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "是，还是不是？", "char_start": 358, "char_end": 365}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "对不起，你的口头回答我不相信。", "char_start": 366, "char_end": 381}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "我先不感动、不倾倒一年再说，亲眼看看你的所作所为会告诉我什么答案。", "char_start": 382, "char_end": 415}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你在朋友圈哀怨一声试试。", "char_start": 416, "char_end": 428}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "第三，你是不是有一帮兄弟 / 闺蜜在一路看着你“为了我而自强不息”，已经感动得泣不成声，ta们正在家里等着你表白成功的好消息？或者等着替你痛斥我这毒女 / 渣男？", "char_start": 430, "char_end": 511}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "所以，你是在我不知情、未同意的前提下，拿自己的几年生命，要把我放在这个不答应就不是人、要为千夫所指、身败名裂的位置上，因为你想要得到我，是吗？", "char_start": 513, "char_end": 584}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你是基于什么样的逻辑，觉得这是个可以确定无疑的证明你对我的爱的计划？", "char_start": 585, "char_end": 619}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "所以，你要告诉我，在这么多年里，你没有考虑过“我如果不愿意”你这些作为对我的伤害性，还是要告诉我你考虑到了，但你还是决定要实施到底？", "char_start": 620, "char_end": 686}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "什么叫“为了我而变优秀”？", "char_start": 687, "char_end": 700}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "Let me make it crystal clear，如果一个人觉得自己本身作为追求卓越的理由根本不值得动动手指头，只有加上“能讨另一个人的欢心”这样的理由才能爬起床来努力，", "char_start": 701, "char_end": 790}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "那么这样的动机下取得的成就越卓越，这成就所证明的就越不是什么“爱”或“志气”，而是这人的自我蔑视。", "char_start": 791, "char_end": 840}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "只有别人才值得你奋斗，你自己在你眼里不值。", "char_start": 841, "char_end": 862}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你为什么要千方百计让你所爱的人去爱一个你自己觉得一文不值的人？", "char_start": 863, "char_end": 894}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "不要干这种损人利己的事。", "char_start": 895, "char_end": 907}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "不错，损人利己——你得到了优秀，不管实际是什么程度，你得到了，别人得到的只有被抬高到天上的自由的成本——这种成本实际上剥夺了人的自由。", "char_start": 908, "char_end": 975}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "损人利己。", "char_start": 976, "char_end": 981}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "损人利己，还要讨赏，还是要人拿下半生来打的赏。", "char_start": 982, "char_end": 1005}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "这就是你“为了追而变优秀”后拿去表白，人家无法对你明言的感受。", "char_start": 1006, "char_end": 1037}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "仅仅是拒绝你，未出恶声，已经对你是极限的宽容了。", "char_start": 1038, "char_end": 1062}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "受此大贪婪、大诅咒，未出恶声，这就是对你很深的爱了。", "char_start": 1063, "char_end": 1089}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "你如果懂得这“未出恶声”背后的爱有多难，知道悔恨、感激而不是沉浸在自己所谓的“被辜负”“被侮辱”的怨恨之中，你还有救。", "char_start": 1090, "char_end": 1149}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "只能帮你到这里了。", "char_start": 1150, "char_end": 1159}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 37}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0343"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如果等你变优秀了，再去追喜欢的人，来得及吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034"], "summary": "围绕“未出恶声”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这是一个常见的误解——以为变得优秀就可以让对方喜欢自己。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这是一个常见的误解——以为变得优秀就可以让对方喜欢自己。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "6da6bef4-5c7b-565a-a12d-1c24c83ace99", "source_ordinal": 1732, "reading_ordinal": 2325, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "地球梦", "published_at": "2024-03-02T19:27:49+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/646714159/answer/3416205569"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "将来中国会有一个有意思的现象——韩日乃至欧美的国民大批的赴华做手术治疗，用他们私人的资金来享受中国医疗服务。而老年人则大批的拿着年金前往中国就医、终老，只是死亡后才回葬本国。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 87}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "当然，这类对非国民的医疗服务不享受国民补贴，要按一般市场价格支付。但即便如此，还是要比它们本国的医疗费用便宜的多。", "char_start": 88, "char_end": 145}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这种医疗、养老服务贸易甚至变成各国国对华的主要逆差来源之一，搞成海南、广西、云南、贵州乃至中西部的一种重要要产业。", "char_start": 146, "char_end": 203}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这些国家还深感幸运——帮他们解开了一条社会绞索。", "char_start": 204, "char_end": 228}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "因为这几乎是他们解决医疗和养老问题的唯一可负担的方案。", "char_start": 229, "char_end": 256}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这些钱给他们本国的医生护士们赚，塞牙缝都不够。", "char_start": 257, "char_end": 280}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "根本的原因在于——在票选制资本主义国家，医药利益集团是不可战胜而且必然趋向垄断的利益团体。", "char_start": 281, "char_end": 326}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "垄断定了，而且不可战胜。", "char_start": 327, "char_end": 339}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "首先，ta们的垄断权是由专业优势所自然赋予的，因此在“个人自由神圣不可侵犯”的前提下，只要ta们自己不战胜自己的利益诉求，就无法可解。而在资本主义的意识形态下，你可以呼唤、倡议，但却不能要求任何人放弃追求自己最大福利的权力。否则国体都要动摇。", "char_start": 340, "char_end": 461}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "第二，ta们将是不可战胜的。", "char_start": 462, "char_end": 476}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "作为手握全体成员生死、寿命、健康的霸主，ta们有能力获得任何自己需要的利润率，以至于ta们可以轻松的为任何形式的抗议成员提供利益保底。", "char_start": 477, "char_end": 544}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "医护联合会安排你罢工，你被取消了行医资格是吗？简单，回头安排你去药企做研发、做行政，提一点药费医疗费保险费，区区几万人几年工资何足道哉？", "char_start": 545, "char_end": 613}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "政府嘛，这一届不好，下一个更乖，到时候ta敢不大赦天下，让你们执照还原，我们就再换一届政府好了。", "char_start": 614, "char_end": 662}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "难道有哪届政府能不要医疗？ta们够狠，选民不怕疼吗？", "char_start": 663, "char_end": 689}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "在这两条根植在社会契约底层的优势加持下，医药联合体必然倾向于保持“消费饥渴”，通过限制服务，来提高有限的服务的稀缺性、从而轻松的赚取超额利润。", "char_start": 690, "char_end": 761}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "同样赚五百亿美元，我为什么呢要用500的单价提供1亿次服务？我当然希望用5000的单价提供1000万次服务了。", "char_start": 762, "char_end": 817}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "是的，国民有4千万人，只有1000万次服务意味着其中60%国民基本都享受不到，而剩下的40%不得不去夺走那60%国民的救命钱来保住自己的性命，但“这就是生活”，不是吗？", "char_start": 818, "char_end": 902}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "因此，在提供“可负担的医疗服务”方面，社会主义国家有制度性的压倒优势。", "char_start": 903, "char_end": 938}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "在无法解决医疗集团残暴垄断的前提下，资本主义国家的国民很快会发现，较大的病症最好干脆把超额保费剩下来，直接去社会主义国家用现金购买不含补贴的医疗服务。", "char_start": 939, "char_end": 1014}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "即使不含补贴，也要比西方国家所谓“有保险补贴”的医疗服务划算得多。", "char_start": 1015, "char_end": 1048}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "小病靠止痛片，大病靠中国/古巴，在交通费用、签证费用、以及中国古巴的医疗技术大幅赶上欧美日韩的前提下，会变得越来越可行。", "char_start": 1049, "char_end": 1109}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "毕竟，“西方赚钱东方花”才是真正的地球梦，不是吗？", "char_start": 1110, "char_end": 1135}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "对来华外国人提供大量优质平价医疗服务，可以赚取相当的收入补贴我国自己国民的医疗保健费用，帮助我国的医疗技术、会技术、医疗机械、基建和药物生产、研发产业链的全面发展。", "char_start": 1136, "char_end": 1218}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "不但如此，还可以吸纳大量的青年就业人口——护理陪伴服务是ai无法替代的服务之一。", "char_start": 1219, "char_end": 1259}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "并且还可以吸纳各国优秀青年人才——印度、巴基斯坦、孟加拉、菲律宾、乃至韩国、印尼、马来……的年轻人可以通过汉语考试和专业选拔来华学医——这在他们本国是贫寒人家轮不上机会的。", "char_start": 1260, "char_end": 1346}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "这也可以很好的弥补我国本身医疗人力资源的匮乏。", "char_start": 1347, "char_end": 1370}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "在这种国际竞争、用脚投票的威慑下，各国自己的医疗系统自然也就必须要有所收敛，否则病人戴着呼吸机也要挣扎到中国来做手术、疗养，可不就尴尬了？", "char_start": 1371, "char_end": 1440}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "真心是一个多赢的解决方案。", "char_start": 1441, "char_end": 1454}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 28}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0343"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：韩国医生拒绝复工要求，警方展开查抄行动，韩国担忧「3 月医疗大乱」，此次风波将产生哪些影响？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028"], "summary": "围绕“地球梦”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“将来中国会有一个有意思的现象——韩日乃至欧美的国民大批的赴华做手术治疗，用他们私人的资金来享受中国医疗服务。而老年人则大批的拿着年金前往中国就医、终老，只是死亡后才回葬本国。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "将来中国会有一个有意思的现象——韩日乃至欧美的国民大批的赴华做手术治疗，用他们私人的资金来享受中国医疗服务。而老年人则大批的拿着年金前往中国就医、终老，只是死亡后才回葬本国。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 87, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d0797a73-21e9-505d-bce8-4d4c47eda5b2", "source_ordinal": 1731, "reading_ordinal": 2326, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "暖气片", "published_at": "2024-03-03T03:37:13+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/567674732/answer/3416554709"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "人要学得“物理”一点。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "Be physical, not psychological.", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 43}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "健康人的尿液是近乎无菌的液体——它毕竟是经过肾小球细胞层从分子尺度滤过的液体，从物理层面上讲是很干净的东西，只是因为文化心理问题导致人对这些东西有恐惧、反感、恶心感。", "char_start": 44, "char_end": 127}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "类似的东西还有蛇、昆虫、粪便、蠕虫、高空、火……等等等等残留在文化和生理本能之中的反射性恐惧。", "char_start": 128, "char_end": 175}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "了解、解构并对这些本能恐惧祛魅，是一个人完成人格发育之中重要的功课。", "char_start": 176, "char_end": 210}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "一个人格发育成熟的人，别说什么“看不见的飞溅微沫”，就算你直接尿在脚上、身上，只要没有触及粘膜、开放性伤口，心里是没什么波澜的。", "char_start": 211, "char_end": 275}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "无实质伤害的平常事耳，不值得计较。", "char_start": 276, "char_end": 293}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "ta们看到乱窜的老鼠蟑螂，并不会尖叫蹦跳，因为很清楚这类小动物对健康的人类伤害性接近于零，身穿皮鞋和严整的衣物，不做突然的动作让对方应激受惊、不将其逼入死角，没有什么可担忧的。", "char_start": 294, "char_end": 382}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "看到油污、脏乱的桌面并不至于厌恶、恶心到食难下咽，因为我们人类的嗅觉非常敏锐，所以尽管可以闻得到一些气味，只要不是浓烈到非常刺激，其实浓度很低，对人的威胁几乎可以忽略，拉开点距离就能保持安全。", "char_start": 383, "char_end": 479}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "成年人之所以能成为他人的依靠而不是负担，一个根本的原因，就在于这种对反射性恐惧的祛魅，使得成年人的情绪、心态处于一个远比未成年人不容易应激、失控的稳定状态。", "char_start": 480, "char_end": 558}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "那不是靠“勇敢”，也不是靠“神经大条”或者“迟钝”，而是靠仔细的研究、清醒的认识和刻意的自我磨练、系统的接受的结果。", "char_start": 559, "char_end": 617}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "一个人越能战胜和超越自己从文化、生物本能里继承来的反射性恐惧，就自然能为一切合作伙伴、身边伴侣留下更大的生长余地。", "char_start": 618, "char_end": 675}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "对这也纠结、对那也敏感、对这个也紧张得睡不着、对那也害怕得发抖……那么就只好让身边人这个不要提、那个不要碰、这里不要做、那里不要去……", "char_start": 676, "char_end": 743}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "活生生让自身的恐惧化身为爱人的牢笼，把对自己有爱的人背转手铐在暖气片上，永世不得超生。", "char_start": 744, "char_end": 787}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你有没有这个权利？", "char_start": 788, "char_end": 797}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "有的，ta说爱你，ta就给了。", "char_start": 798, "char_end": 813}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "哪怕最后不能满足，至少你提出诉求的权利是明确、肯定的有的。", "char_start": 814, "char_end": 843}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "但如果你永远站在你的反射性恐惧的一边，那么ta很可怜。", "char_start": 844, "char_end": 871}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "也恐怕难以坚持。", "char_start": 872, "char_end": 880}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这无所谓对错，只是恐怕你们终究无缘。", "char_start": 881, "char_end": 899}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "简单来说——一个人若有幸被爱，与自身的恐惧奋战乃是自然法指给被爱者的义务。", "char_start": 901, "char_end": 938}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "怠慢这个义务，放在你身上的爱是会被自然法取走的。", "char_start": 939, "char_end": 963}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "那时又怕你要心里愁苦，嚎啕痛哭了。", "char_start": 964, "char_end": 981}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0343"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：让男朋友坐在马桶上上厕所很过分吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023"], "summary": "围绕“暖气片”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“人要学得“物理”一点。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "人要学得“物理”一点。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "0e16eafb-fadb-5e76-8fa2-812655ef5318", "source_ordinal": 1730, "reading_ordinal": 2327, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "女士优先", "published_at": "2024-03-03T07:21:14+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/580230834/answer/3416595631"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "首先，there is no saying as “lady first”, only “ladies first”.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 59}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这实际上是“女士们优先”。", "char_start": 60, "char_end": 73}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "意思是女士们要优先得到安全和服务，然后才轮到男士们。", "char_start": 74, "char_end": 100}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这是源于一个非常朴素的事实——人类种群要延续，在最糟糕的条件下，可以只需要极少的男性，但需要大量的女性。", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 153}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "也就是说——如果遇到什么危险、入侵，为了应对危机，种群里的男性牺牲很多，但女性基本得到了保全，那么这个危机之后，这个种群规模会得到最快的恢复，能更快的重新获得应付下一次危机的能力。", "char_start": 154, "char_end": 244}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这意味着如果一个种群里的男性天然的有为女性付出和牺牲的精神，他们所处的这整个基因池就更容易稳定遗传，而不是更多的趋向于灭绝。", "char_start": 245, "char_end": 307}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "如果有两个种群，彼此存在竞争关系，但A部落的男性有更多的这种本能倾向，而B部落则恰恰相反，那么数学上讲，A部落的基因性状会渐渐成为最后的赢家。", "char_start": 308, "char_end": 379}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这并不需要什么“狡猾的教会”或者“愚蠢的骑士阶层”来缔造先例，只是所有能从残酷的生存竞争里存活下来的智人种从自然选择中继承的天然的社会性遗产。", "char_start": 380, "char_end": 451}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "还不等人类读书识字，人类的男性已经从本能中继承了这种行为模式。", "char_start": 452, "char_end": 483}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "所以你要问凭什么，那么严格意义上讲，是凭自然法。", "char_start": 484, "char_end": 508}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "而且同样的自然法也在女性的基因中刻画下了这样的本能——“不从此命者，勿留其后”。", "char_start": 509, "char_end": 549}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "因为基于同样的原理——不介意男性没有这种倾向的女性如果在一个部落中比例过大，同样容易导致部落灭亡，她们的基因也会随之湮灭。", "char_start": 550, "char_end": 611}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你如果以为抖几句机灵，招呼一群兄弟来“义愤填膺”，或者在故纸堆里罗织一些文化黑料扣上些“封建残余”“女权迫害”之类的时髦罪名，就能免疫于数百万年自然选择刻在女性下意识里的筛选机制，没人会拦着你。", "char_start": 612, "char_end": 709}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "也许你是天选之子，比过去那不知几亿因此血脉断绝在历史中的叔伯祖们运气都好，这谁知道呢？", "char_start": 710, "char_end": 753}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0343"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：男朋友问凭什么女士优先，我怎么反驳？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“女士优先”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“首先，there is no saying as “lady first”, only “ladies first”.”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "首先，there is no saying as “lady first”, only “ladies first”.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 59, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "c2c4937a-4e28-575c-9f16-85ee7c5193a2", "source_ordinal": 1729, "reading_ordinal": 2328, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "除三害", "published_at": "2024-03-04T05:50:01+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/646235050/answer/3417591369"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这片能在没有分级制度的大陆公映还真是有点出乎意料。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "别的不谈，单说这个突出描写的邪教问题。", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 45}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "1）邪教不怕杀。", "char_start": 46, "char_end": 54}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "用“肉体消灭”的方式要去消灭邪教，往往反而会给邪教成员“笑对死亡”的证道机会，结果往往是进一步的增强了这些教派对一些向往脱离死亡恐惧的人的感召力。", "char_start": 55, "char_end": 128}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "人对脱离死亡恐惧都是向往的，所以这绝不是一个小问题——这在历史上往往反而会导致该教派不断浴火重生。", "char_start": 129, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "一些目睹这种从容的幸存者非常容易因此“道心坚固”，成为下一代教派领袖。", "char_start": 179, "char_end": 214}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "公平地讲，这不只是邪教有这个属性，是一切能让人战胜死亡的意识形态，无论是宗教还是党派，都会有这种特殊的性质。", "char_start": 215, "char_end": 269}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "某种意义上讲，这是开宗立派的天然资格。也是为什么光靠镇压不能简单的消灭任何这类超越性的意识形态的原因。", "char_start": 270, "char_end": 321}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "最后还是要靠讲道理，靠历史变迁的长期作用。", "char_start": 322, "char_end": 343}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "邪教最终的结局，不会是“信的人都被杀光”，而是受到了历史现实本身的挑战，无法在理论上给出既不违背核心教义、又能适应现实挑战的改进，导致教派总体财务破产、人事关系崩溃。", "char_start": 344, "char_end": 427}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "2）个人而言，不要听信那些宣扬“弃绝世俗”的教训。", "char_start": 429, "char_end": 454}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "“世俗”——饮食男女、功名利禄——不是反面教材，不是邪恶之源，而是人生和社会中不能回避的部分。", "char_start": 455, "char_end": 502}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "不管是什么意识形态，都需要直面这些考题，要把这些考题考过，至少得个及格。要有一个行得通的——如何谈恋爱、如何自我防卫、如何参与商业竞争、如何参与公共事务……等等一系列问题的答案。", "char_start": 503, "char_end": 592}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "“超脱”、“不执着”只能作为这些答案的要素，而不能变成“我不参加考试”的变相宣言。", "char_start": 593, "char_end": 634}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "因为问题根本就不是你要不要考它，而是它要来考你。", "char_start": 635, "char_end": 659}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "不管“上师”、“尊者”们如何“开示”，你没有资格和机会拒考。", "char_start": 660, "char_end": 690}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这轮不到ta们来给你保证，ta们没有能力保证你不考就能“脱离烦恼”，保证了也没有意义。", "char_start": 691, "char_end": 734}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这又不归ta们管。", "char_start": 735, "char_end": 744}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "举个现实的例子：", "char_start": 745, "char_end": 753}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你问ta怎么谈恋爱，ta说“人要抱着不执着的态度对待爱情”，这算ok。ta说“男女关系是一种罪，人不应该有男女之情”，这就属于“拒考”。", "char_start": 754, "char_end": 822}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你问ta怎么赚钱，ta说“不要只想着赚钱才能赚钱”，这可以——因为这实际上是一个赚钱的方案。ta说“钱都是罪恶的，你不能沾钱”，这就是“拒考”。", "char_start": 823, "char_end": 895}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "为啥？因为“拒考”在本质上是反社会的。如果把这作为解决方案，人类社会后果发生根本性的功能障碍，医院、消防局、应急中心、环卫系统、工厂、农场……全部都要瘫痪。", "char_start": 896, "char_end": 974}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "七八十亿人如果退回到“光着屁股独自禁欲摘野果子吃”这种“完美拒考”状态，得到的绝不可能是“毫无苦痛的人间天堂”，只会是地狱。", "char_start": 975, "char_end": 1037}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "记住，只有“如何有效的恋爱、劳动、自卫、竞争……”算答案，“建议拒考”不算。", "char_start": 1038, "char_end": 1076}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "有人要说，这是否意味着一切可以接受的意识形态都必须是某种实质的“成功学”？", "char_start": 1077, "char_end": 1114}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "不错，一切可以接受的意识形态都必须是指向社会繁荣的成功学。", "char_start": 1115, "char_end": 1144}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "成功的是秉持这种意识形态的社会，是秉持这种意识形态的社会要在幸存、繁荣的竞赛中赢过与之抵触、对立的社会。", "char_start": 1145, "char_end": 1197}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "一切可以经受历史考验的意识形态体系必须是“社会的成功学”。在确保社会成功基础之上，为个人的幸福、满足提供解决方案。", "char_start": 1198, "char_end": 1255}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "因此这个方案必然的以“成为卓有有效的社会成员”来定义成功，而不会以“赢过所有社会成员”、“争夺到最多的社会资源”为成功定义。", "char_start": 1256, "char_end": 1318}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "按照前一种定义，也同样可以说它们是个人的“成功学”。", "char_start": 1319, "char_end": 1345}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "而在将“成功”定义为“击败所有其它社会成员”、“（不计社会后果）争夺到最多社会资源”的前提下，则可以斩钉截铁的说任何合格的意识形态都不可能是这种“成功学”。", "char_start": 1346, "char_end": 1424}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "因为它在数学上就指向其社群的自我湮灭，信奉它就等于上了一条必然沉没的航船。", "char_start": 1425, "char_end": 1462}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "在这个意义上讲，会计学是分辨邪教的终极利器。", "char_start": 1463, "char_end": 1485}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "一个财务不自洽、只能靠不断的消耗外部财富来生存的团体，其意识形态必为邪教。", "char_start": 1486, "char_end": 1523}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 35}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0343"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何评价阮经天主演的犯罪电影《周处除三害》？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034"], "summary": "围绕“除三害”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这片能在没有分级制度的大陆公映还真是有点出乎意料。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这片能在没有分级制度的大陆公映还真是有点出乎意料。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ade09427-54c5-5338-9116-a655d2b041dd", "source_ordinal": 1728, "reading_ordinal": 2329, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "政治端粒", "published_at": "2024-03-04T16:42:45+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/646965914/answer/3418298074"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "不太看好尹锡悦的赢面。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "看上去这是在跟医师协会对抗，其实这些医院95%都是私营医院，背后是占到韩国GDP 70%的财团们，也就是三星现代乐天大宇们。", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 74}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "现在的牌局是尹锡悦最大的王牌也就是这7000人的饭碗，赌这7000人自己会害怕丢掉前途。", "char_start": 75, "char_end": 119}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "殊不知，这跟香港黑暴的原理一样，这7000人肯定是得到了保底承诺的——罢工期间津贴照发，执照吊销期间给你补贴，参加过罢工的保证铁饭碗。", "char_start": 120, "char_end": 187}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "所不同的，是这回做保证的是韩国财团本身，ta们是完全有能力也有动机兑现的——这要不兑现，财团将来会处处败退，因为没人会相信ta们的承诺了。", "char_start": 188, "char_end": 257}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "所以这就是7000死士，别说吊销三个月，就算完全吊销医疗执照，三星现代大宇安排一堆度假酒店、银行主管、生产线主任之类的职位一样可以保证这些人的前途。", "char_start": 258, "char_end": 332}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "所以这7000人何止不觉得这叫倒霉，反而觉得这是纳上投名状、加入核心骨干圈的机会。", "char_start": 333, "char_end": 374}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "老实说，只安排了7000人罢工都算是财团们“爱惜韩国同胞”（或觉得搞定尹锡悦这点成本已经足够了）、保守使用实力的结果。", "char_start": 375, "char_end": 434}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "尹锡悦不就范，再发动多点都不是问题。", "char_start": 435, "char_end": 453}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "难道韩国人可以不看医生？", "char_start": 454, "char_end": 466}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "一旦财团强硬到底，尹锡悦这边就尴尬了。真要立威开除7000人，那么医疗需求就得全靠在岗的那些医护承担。", "char_start": 467, "char_end": 518}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "问题是这些医护可不都是“不舍百姓”才留岗的，其中至少还有相当一部分是“暂时还用不着你们上”才留岗的。", "char_start": 519, "char_end": 569}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你自己想想，平均年薪19.2万的医生们肯为你超额加班多久？人家还要打高尔夫、吃米其林、出国旅游放松的，不然赚这么多钱干什么？", "char_start": 570, "char_end": 632}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这帮人二次再罢工，韩国医疗服务就只剩下更少数的仁医了。而这些人不能不考虑一个问题——如果最后尹锡悦崩了、投降了，“邪恶势力”卷土重来，当初坚持不参加的自己很可能被清算。仁心仁术是一回事，但如果回头会因此被医疗社群集体排挤，搞到因此生涯中断，这就是另一回事了。", "char_start": 633, "char_end": 762}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "于是这部分医生也恐怕坚持不住、会参加第二轮加码罢工。于是进入了更大一轮循环——剩下的工作量要压在更少的一部分人身上，这部分人受到的压力会更大。", "char_start": 763, "char_end": 834}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这就是雪崩效应。", "char_start": 835, "char_end": 843}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "和第二轮加码相比，第一轮这都算先礼后兵了。", "char_start": 844, "char_end": 865}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "现在的局面是尹锡悦天马流星拳打得小宇宙都爆发了，人家黑暗教皇的真身都没出现，实力相差太过悬殊。", "char_start": 866, "char_end": 913}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "老百姓的问题很现实——就算医疗集团很邪恶，但我现在正躺在床上起不来，我没法拿命来争正义。", "char_start": 914, "char_end": 958}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "现在尹锡悦“支持度高涨”，但这高涨的支持率恐怕难以维持。", "char_start": 959, "char_end": 987}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这7000人心怀“必死的觉悟”死撑到底，让医疗危机延续个两三个月，医师协会再来第二轮加码，再罢工七千人，只维持ICU运作，来个医院整体熄灯抗议。", "char_start": 988, "char_end": 1060}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "尹锡悦难道能把全国的医生全灭不成？", "char_start": 1061, "char_end": 1078}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "那时候一旦投降，韩国民众的绝望感不知怎么收拾。", "char_start": 1079, "char_end": 1102}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "老实说，选出尹锡悦真是韩国的不幸。", "char_start": 1103, "char_end": 1120}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "“年轻人政治”作为选票政治的癌症，像细胞端粒一样限制着这种政体的生存周期。", "char_start": 1121, "char_end": 1158}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "选民结构有多年轻，国祚就有多接近尽头。", "char_start": 1159, "char_end": 1178}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 26}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0343"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：韩国 7 千名离岗医生将被吊销执照，会产生哪些影响？韩国医改会打破僵局吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026"], "summary": "围绕“政治端粒”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“不太看好尹锡悦的赢面。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "不太看好尹锡悦的赢面。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "84ddbd0d-bd90-598a-97b2-5f07a00a8b43", "source_ordinal": 1727, "reading_ordinal": 2330, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "富天使", "published_at": "2024-03-05T04:39:49+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/407550109/answer/3418820688"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "不会。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 3}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "但我从未遇到过“善良没有得到相应回报”这种怪事。", "char_start": 4, "char_end": 28}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这其实关键在于你把什么定义为善良、把什么定义为回报。", "char_start": 29, "char_end": 55}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "大多数得不到回报的善良都属于这种情况——它实际上是无效的，接受善行的对象其实没有得到什么帮助。", "char_start": 56, "char_end": 103}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "想去安慰人的，根本就没有安慰着；要去帮忙的，帮的却是倒忙……诸如此类。", "char_start": 104, "char_end": 139}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "发心有了，动作做了，种也播下了，但却没有施肥、浇灌、除虫、收割、脱粒、加工……直到做成一碗能吃的饭的结果。", "char_start": 140, "char_end": 193}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "问题是，这事发展到“播完种”就结束了，没有下文了。", "char_start": 194, "char_end": 219}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "从你这头看，你种子用掉了，播种的工也做了，但从张三的角度看，他一口都没吃到 —— 一口都没吃到，拿什么“回报”你？", "char_start": 220, "char_end": 277}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "所以，善良有一个“最小可用规模”问题，一个“不可再分割、否则将导致其完全无效”的底线。", "char_start": 278, "char_end": 321}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "未达到“最小可用规模”的善良，本质上并不构成有效的善良。而无效的善良很显然是不能把回报机制运转起来的。", "char_start": 322, "char_end": 373}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "滴水之恩，涌泉相报，问题是那滴水得喝到嘴里啊。", "char_start": 374, "char_end": 397}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "一个真的要跑通“行善-回报”循环的人，就必须在行善的定义里内嵌进“必须达成最小可用要求”的要素。", "char_start": 398, "char_end": 446}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "也就是说——ta必须将没有达成最小可用要求的付出视为“未达成的善良”，并且不把这类“未达成的善良未得到回报”的事实视为“善良得不到回报”的案例。", "char_start": 447, "char_end": 519}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "因为这责任落不到受惠人头上。", "char_start": 520, "char_end": 534}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "人根本没收到能用的货，哪来的欠款啊？", "char_start": 535, "char_end": 553}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这也是为什么成熟的人们不会轻易“付出善良”，因为这个“最小可用”的质量要求其实并不总是那么简单。人年纪越大，思考问题越深入，越会发现光是清晰的定义出“最小可用交付物”就是个很大的课题了，把这个东西做出来反倒未见得真的多难。", "char_start": 554, "char_end": 665}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这是个设计规划能力问题。", "char_start": 666, "char_end": 678}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "规划经验足、设计能力强的人，为对方着想的时候能想到很多套方案，在其中选一个满足以下要求的方案：", "char_start": 679, "char_end": 726}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "1）对对方可用", "char_start": 727, "char_end": 734}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "2）产生的效益足以支付你付出的成本", "char_start": 735, "char_end": 752}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "3）还有一些额外收益可以和你分享变成你的利润", "char_start": 753, "char_end": 775}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "4）你自己还可以负担其成本和风险", "char_start": 776, "char_end": 792}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "只有满足了这四个条件，一件善行才拥有了可以付诸实施的条件。", "char_start": 793, "char_end": 822}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "而在这个条件下，施惠者实际上是看准了盈利机制的，自己就是这个盈利方案的提出者和投资人。要是自己提出的这个方案不灵，那当然怪自己了。", "char_start": 823, "char_end": 888}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "因为这本质上是在将本求利，自己计算不精，客户没有买单或者愿意支付的报酬不及预期，这属于正常的经营风险和必要学费。", "char_start": 889, "char_end": 945}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "注意这个“必要学费”——这意味着这种计划完备的试验，只要产生数据和理论，就不存在“没有回报”这回事。", "char_start": 946, "char_end": 996}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "所以，在这种系统化善良机制下，一共就几种情况：", "char_start": 997, "char_end": 1020}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "1）根本没算出可以操作的方案，于是根本没出手。没出手哪有没回报一说？", "char_start": 1021, "char_end": 1055}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "2）自认为计算周全，有值得冒险的合理利润。并且也成功了——这意味着对方实现了额外收益并且抹平了你的成本还给了你利润。也就是有回报。", "char_start": 1056, "char_end": 1121}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "3）自认为计算周全，出手了却发现并非如此，没能按计划收回足够利润甚至是成本。但记录良好、操作有序的案例本身可以用来分析提炼经验教训。这是战略性资产，是系统收益，一样是回报。", "char_start": 1122, "char_end": 1208}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "因此，这里根本就不存在“善良没有回报”这个可能。", "char_start": 1209, "char_end": 1233}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "有人要问——如果一定要要求保本甚至盈利，那么要得出有效解可能门槛太高，那岂不是意味着很多人我都根本帮不了？", "char_start": 1234, "char_end": 1287}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "这有两个解决办法：", "char_start": 1288, "char_end": 1297}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "1）如果你确实算不出结果，那么不错，你确实帮不了。", "char_start": 1298, "char_end": 1323}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "你要勉强上去搅合，本质上就像一个明明不会医术的人半路上把人家救护车拦下来一顿操作，想混个见义勇为奖。", "char_start": 1324, "char_end": 1374}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "你这就是找倒霉了。", "char_start": 1375, "char_end": 1384}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "2）你有一个合法的手段可以凭空增加“收益”项，把强制性的盈利要求降低。那就是给“助人的快乐”“天堂积分”之类的东西定个价。这部分不用对方支付你就可以计为收入，这样当然剩下的盈利要求就没那么苛刻了，你会更容易算出成本收入风险平衡的方案来。", "char_start": 1385, "char_end": 1503}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "又有人要问——必须要盈利吗？我就不能一开始就设定为不需要收支风险平衡吗？", "char_start": 1505, "char_end": 1541}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "不行。", "char_start": 1542, "char_end": 1545}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "在“助人的快乐”“天堂积分”都可以入账这么宽松的会计准则下，善良必须盈利。", "char_start": 1546, "char_end": 1583}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "因为只有你盈利了，对方才没有凭空冒出一笔债。", "char_start": 1584, "char_end": 1606}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "如果你在这个准则下都算不出盈利的方案，你就老实坐下！！", "char_start": 1607, "char_end": 1634}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "别拦人家的救护车，造孽。", "char_start": 1635, "char_end": 1647}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "不要以为善良就可以无能。", "char_start": 1649, "char_end": 1661}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 46}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0343"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如果你的善良并没有得到相应的回报，你还会坚持善良吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044"], "summary": "围绕“富天使”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“不会。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "不会。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 3, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
